### Trigger Event Planner agent
POST http://localhost:5050/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "prompt": "Find a venue in Austin for a company gala"
}

### Crash Recovery: run under an ID you own
### Blocks while tool 2 compares venues for ~30s. Kill the app during that window
### with the request below. Restarting the app is what recovers the run; send this
### exact request again only to read back its answer, because the crash killed the
### connection that was waiting for one.
### Add "kill_after_seconds": 8 to the body and the app halts itself 8s in, so you
### can skip the kill request below and run the demo in two terminals.
POST http://localhost:5050/crash/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "gala-42",
    "prompt": "Find a venue in Austin for a company gala"
}

### Crash Recovery: kill the app while the run above is in flight
POST http://localhost:5050/crash/kill
